      "side": 1,
      "message": "You need to use the sink policy flags to actually send the command to the PDC.  On a battery status change, you need to set the policy flag to let the sink policy handler send the actual command.\n\nSee `enum policy_snk_attached_t`.\n\n```\npdc_battery_status_change()\n{\n    /* Potentially cache new battery status and capabilities in the\n     * PDC subsystem here\n     */\n    for (all PDC ports) {\n        if (pdc is SNK_ATTACHED)\n            atomic_set_bit(snk_policy.flags, SNK_UPDATE_BATTERY_STATUS);\n    }\n}\n```\n\nTest the new policy flag and send the actual command to the PDC in `run_snk_policies()`.",
